WEBVTT

00:31:28.204 --> 00:31:32.163
He ended up giving us a bonus. And what?

00:31:32.163 --> 00:31:35.704
Yeah, you got a bonus for admitting
that your project wasn't promising

00:31:35.704 --> 00:31:36.788
and shutting it down?

00:31:37.079 --> 00:31:40.871
We did. It only solidified that culture
that he was already creating.

00:31:41.079 --> 00:31:42.704
Didn't that mean admitting failure, though
?

00:31:44.079 --> 00:31:49.288
Well, my job as a rapid evaluator was to
evaluate and this was my evaluation.

00:31:49.288 --> 00:31:55.954
So I didn't see it that way because
it's like if you punish failure

00:31:55.954 --> 00:31:58.413
and you simultaneously
know it's inevitable,

00:31:58.621 --> 00:32:03.288
then you are creating an environment where
people are inclined to hide it